{"sourceLanguage":"en","version":"1.0","strings":{"Devices":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Naprave"}}}},"Macs that connected with minigw. The switch allows Siri AI, which answers with this Mac's personal data. This Mac always has it. A removed device appears again when it connects, with Siri off.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maci, ki so se povezali z minigw. Stikalo dovoli Siri AI, ki odgovarja z osebnimi podatki tega Maca. Ta Mac jo ima vedno. Odstranjena naprava se ob naslednji povezavi znova pojavi, s Siri izklopljeno."}}}},"Last seen %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nazadnje %@"}}}},"Not seen since Mini Gateway started":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni se povezala od zagona Mini Gateway"}}}},"Siri answers with the personal context of this Mac's user (notes, documents, messages that Apple Intelligence can use). Anyone with the router token, also from another Mac, can get answers from it. Siri cannot read your project files.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Siri odgovarja z osebnim kontekstom uporabnika tega Maca (zapiski, dokumenti, sporočila, ki jih lahko uporabi Apple Intelligence). Odgovore lahko dobi vsak, ki ima žeton routerja, tudi z drugega Maca. Datotek projekta Siri ne more brati."}}}},"Agents get every Claude Code tool on this Mac, but files only in the allowed folders: commands run in a sandbox that cannot read your home folder or write outside these folders.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agenti dobijo vsa orodja Claude Code na tem Macu, datoteke pa le v dovoljenih mapah: ukazi tečejo v sandboxu, ki ne more brati domače mape niti pisati zunaj teh map."}}}},"Remove":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odstrani"}}}},"Agents work only in these folders. Folders shared from other Macs (minigw) are included automatically.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agenti delajo le v teh mapah. Mape, deljene z drugih Macov (minigw), so vključene samodejno."}}}},"Allowed folders":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoljene mape"}}}},"Add Folder…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dodaj mapo …"}}}},"Add":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dodaj"}}}},"Allow local tools":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli lokalna orodja"}}}},"Tools":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Orodja"}}}},"Open at Login":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odpri ob prijavi"}}}},"Open Login Items":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odpri elemente ob prijavi"}}}},"Waiting for approval in System Settings → General → Login Items.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Čaka na odobritev v Sistemskih nastavitvah → Splošno → Elementi ob prijavi."}}}},"Could not change: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spremembe ni bilo mogoče shraniti: %@"}}}},"Quit & Reopen":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Končaj in znova odpri"}}}},"Download…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prenesi …"}}}},"Install":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Namesti"}}}},"Reinstall":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Namesti znova"}}}},"Installed: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nameščeno: %@"}}}},"Installed: %@ – add %@ to your PATH":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nameščeno: %1$@ – dodajte %2$@ v PATH"}}}},"Not installed":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni nameščeno"}}}},"Install failed: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Namestitev ni uspela: %@"}}}},"Saved: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shranjeno: %@"}}}},"Save failed: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shranjevanje ni uspelo: %@"}}}},"Command-line tool":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ukaz v terminalu"}}}},"On the other Mac run: minigw connect %@ --token <token>":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na drugem Macu zaženite: minigw connect %@ --token <žeton>"}}}},"Starts Claude Code through this router, e.g. “minigw --model claude-apple-fm”. Also: minigw connect | status | models | disconnect. Install links the signed command into your PATH and connects it; Download saves a copy for another Mac.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zažene Claude Code prek tega routerja, npr. »minigw --model claude-apple-fm«. Še: minigw connect | status | models | disconnect. Namesti poveže podpisani ukaz v vaš PATH in ga poveže z routerjem; Prenesi shrani kopijo za drug Mac."}}}},"General":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Splošno"}}}},"Changes are applied automatically.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spremembe se uveljavijo samodejno."}}}},"Token":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Žeton"}}}},"Models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli"}}}},"Settings…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nastavitve …"}}}},"Hide":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skrij"}}}},"Timeout (s)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Časovna meja (s)"}}}},"Invalid: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Neveljavno: %@"}}}},"Base URL":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Osnovni URL"}}}},"Quit":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Končaj"}}}},"Setting sources":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Viri nastavitev"}}}},"Accessibility: allowed":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dostopnost: dovoljeno"}}}},"Disable All":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Onemogoči vse"}}}},"Enable the provider to load its models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omogočite ponudnika, da se naložijo modeli"}}}},"Error: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Napaka: %@"}}}},"Enter an API key to enable":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Za vklop vnesite ključ API"}}}},"API key (default; enter to replace)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ključ API (privzeti; vnesite novega za zamenjavo)"}}}},"API key (saved; enter to replace)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ključ API (shranjen; vnesite novega za zamenjavo)"}}}},"Aliases (advanced)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aliasi (napredno)"}}}},"HTTP %@ from %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HTTP %1$@ z %2$@"}}}},"Status":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stanje"}}}},"Server":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Strežnik"}}}},"API key":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ključ API"}}}},"Accessibility: not allowed":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dostopnost: ni dovoljeno"}}}},"Unexpected response from %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nepričakovan odgovor z %@"}}}},"Model":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model"}}}},"Invalid base URL":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Neveljaven osnovni URL"}}}},"Clear":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Počisti"}}}},"Enable All":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omogoči vse"}}}},"Path":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pot"}}}},"Detected: %@ · %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Najdeno: %1$@ · %2$@"}}}},"Context":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontekst"}}}},"Showing %lld of %lld – refine the search to see more":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prikazanih %1$lld od %2$lld – za več zožite iskanje"}}}},"claude not found in PATH":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"claude ni v PATH"}}}},"Select the Claude Code executable":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izberite izvršljivo datoteko Claude Code"}}}},"Provider":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ponudnik"}}}},"Cannot connect (%@). Check that this Mac can reach the server (VPN, firewall). For a device on the same subnet, also allow Mini Gateway in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Povezava ni mogoča (%@). Preverite, ali ta Mac doseže strežnik (VPN, požarni zid). Za napravo v istem podomrežju v Sistemskih nastavitvah → Zasebnost in varnost → Lokalno omrežje dovolite tudi Mini Gateway."}}}},"Show":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pokaži"}}}},"No API key":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni ključa API"}}}},"%lld of %lld enabled":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%1$lld od %2$lld omogočenih"}}}},"Allowed clients (IP; empty = all)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoljeni odjemalci (IP; prazno = vsi)"}}}},"Copy Token":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiraj žeton"}}}},"One per line “alias = upstream ID, context window” (e.g. qwen = qwen\/qwen3-coder, 128k). When set, these define the models instead of the table.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Po en na vrstico »alias = upstream ID, kontekstno okno« (npr. qwen = qwen\/qwen3-coder, 128k). Če so vpisani, določajo modele namesto tabele."}}}},"Stopped":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ustavljen"}}}},"Instructions":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Navodila"}}}},"Port":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vrata"}}}},"Activity":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dejavnost"}}}},"Loading models…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nalagam modele …"}}}},"Choose…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izberi …"}}}},"Duration":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trajanje"}}}},"Tools (comma-separated; empty = none)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Orodja (ločena z vejico; prazno = brez)"}}}},"Unexpected response from \/v1\/models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nepričakovan odgovor z \/v1\/models"}}}},"Search models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Iskanje modelov"}}}},"Permission mode":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Način dovoljenj"}}}},"Cannot connect (%@)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Povezava ni mogoča (%@)"}}}},"HTTP %@ – check the API key":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HTTP %@ – preverite ključ API"}}}},"Open Accessibility Settings":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odpri nastavitve dostopnosti"}}}},"Activity…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dejavnost …"}}}},"No requests":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni zahtev"}}}},"Time":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Čas"}}}},"Listening on %@:%@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Posluša na %1$@:%2$@"}}}},"New Token":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nov žeton"}}}},"Enabled":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omogočeno"}}}},"Executable (empty = auto-detect)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izvršljiva datoteka (prazno = samodejno)"}}}},"Address":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Naslov"}}}},"Choose":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izberi"}}}},"Refresh":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Osveži"}}}},"Save and Restart":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shrani in znova zaženi"}}}},"Allow unencrypted connections from other Macs":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli nešifrirane povezave z drugih Macov"}}}},"minigw 0.4 and newer always encrypts. Turn on only for other clients on a trusted network.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"minigw 0.4 in novejši vedno šifrira. Vklopite le za druge odjemalce v zaupanja vrednem omrežju."}}}}}}